  "description": "PDFiumZ - Modern .NET wrapper for Google PDFium. Convert PDF to image, extract text, create PDF, edit PDF, render PDF pages, manipulate form fields, add annotations, bookmarks. High-level fluent API + low-level P/Invoke bindings. Cross-platform: Windows, Linux, macOS. Based on PDFium 145.0.7592 (Chromium 145). Supports .NET 10.0, 9.0, 8.0, .NET Standard 2.1, 2.0. QuestPDF-style declarative document generation. HTML to PDF conversion.",
